WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.912
In the final years of Shang, King Zhou was the dynasty's last ruler.

00:00:04.262 --> 00:00:08.510
Traditional stories describe him as a cruel ruler.

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:13.420
Daji is a famous figure connected with King Zhou.

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:17.682
King Zhou loved enjoying life together with Daji.

00:00:18.032 --> 00:00:23.864
King Zhou held banquet after banquet, slowly neglecting the affairs of state.

00:00:24.214 --> 00:00:28.558
The people's lives grew harder and harder, and discontent grew in their hearts.

00:00:28.908 --> 00:00:33.684
None of his ministers' advice could reach King Zhou.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:38.426
And so, day by day, the strength of Shang faded away.

00:00:38.776 --> 00:00:42.904
Later novels added many tales of gods and spirits.

00:00:43.254 --> 00:00:47.550
These stories are thrilling, but they are not real history.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.844
In the end, Shang was defeated by the Zhou army, and a new era began.

00:00:53.194 --> 00:00:58.138
The fall of a dynasty cannot be blamed on Daji alone.

